+        "[memguard] %s: system RAM still %.1f%% after waiting %.0fs "
+        "(limit %.0f%%). Nothing freed up, so this render is stopping "
+        "rather than taking the host down. Use a shorter segment, a lower "
+        "resolution, or raise DUBBING_MEM_GUARD_PCT."
+        % (where, pct if pct is not None else -1, waited, _MEM_LIMIT_PCT))
